      "dialogue_id": "nsb_s05_judge_01", "speaker_actor_id": "judge", "target_actor_id": "pure",
      "timeout_seconds": 12.0,
      "note": "\"...This court's record-keeping is not in error.\" Tone-deaf, not malicious -- a bureaucratic frame that never touches what he asked. That's its own cruelty.",
